@apiUrl = http://localhost:14100

### API health
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### All patients
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/patients
Accept: application/json

### Patient details
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/patients/65da26b0-3a12-4f8e-8509-9c7d94591ab9
Accept: application/json

### Missing patient
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/problem+json

### All doctors
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/doctors
Accept: application/json

### Doctors filtered by specialty
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/doctors?specialty=Кардиолог
Accept: application/json

### Doctor specialties
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/doctors/specialties
Accept: application/json

### All diseases
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/diseases
Accept: application/json
